```

capture-update.text:
Keep using native build and test commands in your working tree. After changing dependency selection, refresh the lock and prepare the selected dependencies:

```sh
{commands.update}
{commands.prefetch}
```

Use the project directory and lockfile from your setup for the placeholders.
